cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ProofRail — Reproducibility Package"
message: "If you use this package, please cite both the thesis and this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dhage
    given-names: Rajdeep
    affiliation: "A. Gary Anderson Graduate School of Management, University of California, Riverside"
abstract: >-
  Data, per-transaction execution logs, metric computation code, a standalone
  audit-chain verifier, and KNIME comparison workflows supporting the benchmark
  results for ProofRail, an event-driven conditional settlement engine operating
  on existing bank rails without tokenization.
keywords:
  - conditional settlement
  - payment systems
  - financial inclusion
  - hash-linked audit log
  - reproducibility
  - synthetic data
license: MIT
